                           set [4mDISPLAY[24m explicitly, as that will render the X11 connection insecure (and will require the user to manually copy any required authorization cookies).

     [4mHOME[24m                  Set to the path of the user's home directory.

     [4mLOGNAME[24m               Synonym for [4mUSER[24m; set for compatibility with systems that use this variable.

