     [4mPATH[24m                  Set to the default [4mPATH[24m, as specified when compiling [1mssh[22m.

     [4mSSH_ASKPASS[24m           If [1mssh [22mneeds a passphrase, it will read the passphrase from the current terminal if it was run from a terminal.  If [1mssh [22mdoes not have a terminal associated with it  but
                           [4mDISPLAY[24m  and  [4mSSH_ASKPASS[24m are set, it will execute the program specified by [4mSSH_ASKPASS[24m and open an X11 window to read the passphrase.  This is particularly useful when
